shellCompleteDispatch(prefix, directory, environment, mode) -> sorted names
    Snapshot effective session environment. Command mode without a slash searches executable names in session PATH.
    Path mode and slash-containing command prefixes resolve against session cwd and HOME; directories retain a trailing separator.
    Return matching literal names, deduplicating commands and filtering command files for executability.
shellQuotedFragment(prefix) -> opening position, unescaped text, found
    Find the current open Smalltalk string, respecting doubled apostrophes and spaces.
shellRemoteCompletions(shell, selector, prefix) -> candidates
    Ask the live Shell for command or path candidates and retrieve its Array values.
shellQuotedCompletion(line, cursor, opening, fragment, candidates) -> edited line, cursor, changed
    Extend the string with the common match prefix and escaped apostrophes.
    A unique file or command closes the quote and adds a space; a directory remains open for continued navigation.
